@startuml C3-Componentes-Collector
' C3 - Componentes dentro do container CLI / Runner (collector.py)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 220

package "CLI / Runner (collector.py)" #LightSkyBlue {
  component "CollectorRunner\nCoordena execução de coleta" as CollectorRunner
  component "GoogleSearchClient\nBusca URLs de Instagram no Google" as GoogleSearchClient
  component "InstagramPageParser\nExtrai metadados, mídias e comentários" as InstagramPageParser
  component "MediaExtractor\nConverte DOM em objetos de mídia" as MediaExtractor
  component "MediaClassifier\nClassifica IMAGE / VIDEO / CAROUSEL" as MediaClassifier
  component "MediaArchiver (Facade)\nDecide local vs Drive (APP_ENV)" as MediaArchiverComp
  component "PhotoArchiver\nBaixa/armazenar fotos" as PhotoArchiver
  component "VideoArchiver\nBaixa/armazenar vídeos" as VideoArchiver
  component "Database (db.py)\ncreate_run / upserts" as DBRepo
  component "EnvironmentConfig\nLê .env e expõe APP_ENV, banco, 2Captcha, Drive" as EnvConfigComp
}

CollectorRunner --> GoogleSearchClient : busca URLs\nde posts / perfis
CollectorRunner --> InstagramPageParser : obtém metadados\ne DOM
CollectorRunner --> MediaExtractor : extrai lista\nde mídias
CollectorRunner --> DBRepo : persiste posts,\nexecuções e mídias
CollectorRunner --> MediaArchiverComp : solicita download\ne armazenamento
CollectorRunner --> EnvConfigComp : lê configs\nde ambiente

MediaExtractor --> MediaClassifier : classifica tipo\nde cada mídia
MediaArchiverComp --> PhotoArchiver : encaminha fotos\n(IMAGE)
MediaArchiverComp --> VideoArchiver : encaminha vídeos\n(VIDEO)

@enduml